      <link>https://sipi.bot/learn/spend-firewall-guide</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://sipi.bot/learn/spend-firewall-guide</guid>
      <description>The complete guide to AI agent spend control: what a spend firewall is, the 6 rule types every autonomous agent needs, how it differs from LLM budgets and observability tools, and how to deploy one in 5 lines of code. By sipi.bot.</description>
