      <link>https://sipi.bot/benchmarks/runaway-incident-frequency</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://sipi.bot/benchmarks/runaway-incident-frequency</guid>
      <description>How do autonomous AI agents run away and overspend? A practical guide to retry loops, unattended sessions, and the pre-spend rules that bound them.</description>
